/Users/manuelturpin/Desktop/bonsai974/claude/lab/lab-30-sentinel/skills/security/agents/_protocol.md-65-**OTEL tracing** — when `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT` is set, Bash subprocesses inherit a W3C `TRACEPARENT` env var (v2.1.98+). Combined with `OTEL_LOG_TOOL_DETAILS=1` (v2.1.101+), this provides per-agent performance traces for identifying slow KB queries and bottleneck agents.
